WEBVTT

00:02.563 --> 00:06.900
Water, earth,

00:06.985 --> 00:10.279
fire, air...

00:11.406 --> 00:15.450
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.535 --> 00:18.829
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.872 --> 00:23.792
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

00:23.876 --> 00:25.711
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.795 --> 00:27.087
he vanished.

00:27.505 --> 00:31.300
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.384 --> 00:32.968
an airbender named Aang.

00:33.052 --> 00:35.345
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.430 --> 00:38.098
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:39.058 --> 00:42.352
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:57.952 --> 00:59.494
I'm not one to complain,

00:59.704 --> 01:02.039
but can't Appa fly any higher?

01:04.083 --> 01:05.500
I have an idea.

01:05.585 --> 01:07.127
Why don't we all get on your back,

01:07.337 --> 01:08.879
and you can fly us to the North Pole.

01:09.088 --> 01:10.422
I'd love to.

01:10.631 --> 01:12.132
Climb on, everyone.

01:12.216 --> 01:14.343
Sokka is ready for takeoff.

01:16.679 --> 01:19.181
Look, we're all just a little tired
and cranky

01:19.265 --> 01:21.350
because we've been flying
for two days straight.

01:21.559 --> 01:22.768
And for what?

01:22.852 --> 01:24.561
We can't even find
the Northern Water Tribe.

01:24.937 --> 01:26.563
There's nothing up here.

01:29.650 --> 01:30.734
Aagh!

01:44.374 --> 01:45.582
They're water benders.

01:45.792 --> 01:47.084
We found the Water Tribe.

01:51.881 --> 01:53.131
He's heading north.

01:53.216 --> 01:55.467
The Northern Water Tribe.

01:55.676 --> 01:58.428
The Avatar
needs to master waterbending.

01:58.638 --> 02:00.514
He is looking for a teacher.

02:00.765 --> 02:03.225
Then what are we waiting for?
Let's go get him.

02:03.434 --> 02:05.644
Patience, Captain Li.

02:05.728 --> 02:07.104
This isn't some little earth village

02:07.188 --> 02:09.189
we can just march into.

02:09.273 --> 02:11.274
The Water Tribe is a great nation.

02:11.484 --> 02:14.945
There's a reason they've survived
100 years of war.

02:15.029 --> 02:16.488
The frozen tundra is treacherous.

02:16.572 --> 02:18.865
The landscape itself
is an icy fortress.

02:19.784 --> 02:22.536
We'll need a massive invasion force.

02:26.290 --> 02:27.290
There it is!

02:28.584 --> 02:31.044
The Northern Water Tribe.

02:31.254 --> 02:32.337
We're finally here.

02:54.444 --> 02:56.862
I can't believe
how many waterbenders live up here.

02:56.988 --> 02:59.406
We'll find a master
to teach us no problem.

03:40.323 --> 03:42.657
This place is beautiful.

03:42.742 --> 03:44.034
Yeah.

03:44.118 --> 03:45.494
She is.

03:57.924 --> 04:00.509
Winter, spring

04:00.593 --> 04:02.969
Summer and fall

04:03.179 --> 04:05.680
Winter, spring

04:05.765 --> 04:08.808
Summer and fall

04:08.893 --> 04:11.436
Four seasons

04:11.646 --> 04:14.231
Four loves

04:14.315 --> 04:17.192
Four seasons

04:17.276 --> 04:19.903
For love

04:41.759 --> 04:44.594
Tonight, we celebrate the arrival

04:44.679 --> 04:46.555
of our brother and sister

04:46.639 --> 04:48.223
from the Southern Tribe.

04:48.641 --> 04:52.018
And they have brought with them
someone very special,

04:52.228 --> 04:54.020
someone who many of us believed

04:54.230 --> 04:57.524
disappeared from the world
until now...

04:57.608 --> 04:59.150
The Avatar.

05:02.989 --> 05:07.701
We also celebrate
my daughter's 16th birthday.

05:07.785 --> 05:11.496
Princess Yue is now of marrying age.

05:12.123 --> 05:13.540
Thank you, Father.

05:13.624 --> 05:15.333
May the great Ocean and Moon Spirits

05:15.418 --> 05:17.752
watch over us
during these troubled times.

05:18.421 --> 05:22.632
Now, Master Pakku
and his students will perform!

05:42.987 --> 05:45.280
Hi there. Sokka, Southern Water Tribe.

05:45.489 --> 05:46.781
Very nice to meet you.

05:49.201 --> 05:51.536
So...

05:52.330 --> 05:54.414
You're a princess?

05:54.498 --> 05:57.834
You know, back in my tribe,
I'm kind of like a prince myself.

05:57.918 --> 05:59.961
Ha! The prince of what?

06:00.046 --> 06:01.296
A lot of things!

06:01.380 --> 06:03.757
Do you mind? I'm trying
to have a conversation here.

06:03.841 --> 06:05.967
My apologies, Prince Sokka.

06:07.928 --> 06:10.597
So, it looks like
I'm gonna be in town for a while.

06:10.681 --> 06:12.599
I'm thinking maybe we could...

06:12.808 --> 06:14.768
Do an activity together?

06:15.144 --> 06:16.561
Do an activity?

06:21.400 --> 06:22.776
Very smooth.

06:23.069 --> 06:24.486
Master Pakku,

06:24.612 --> 06:26.613
meet your newest student:

06:26.697 --> 06:27.906
the Avatar.

06:28.074 --> 06:30.659
Just because
you're destined to save the world,

06:30.868 --> 06:33.119
don't expect any special treatment.

06:34.413 --> 06:37.290
My friend and I can't wait
to start training with you...

06:37.375 --> 06:39.334
After we relax for a couple of days.

06:39.543 --> 06:40.960
If you want to relax,

06:41.170 --> 06:43.254
then I suggest
visiting a tropical island.

06:43.464 --> 06:46.341
If not, I'll see you both at sunrise.

06:46.550 --> 06:47.801
Good night.

06:53.641 --> 06:56.351
For the last time,
I'm not playing the sungi horn.

06:56.435 --> 06:58.603
No, it's about our plans.

06:58.688 --> 07:00.647
There is a bit of a problem.

07:04.318 --> 07:05.902
I'm taking your crew.

07:05.986 --> 07:06.986
What?

07:07.196 --> 07:09.030
I've recruited them
for a little expedition

07:09.240 --> 07:10.573
to the North Pole.

07:10.658 --> 07:12.117
Uncle, is that true?

07:12.326 --> 07:13.660
I'm afraid so.

07:13.869 --> 07:15.453
He's taking everyone...

07:15.663 --> 07:17.247
Even the cook.

07:17.331 --> 07:18.957
Sorry you won't be there

07:19.041 --> 07:20.834
to watch me capture the Avatar,

07:21.043 --> 07:24.421
but I can't have you
getting in my way again.

07:24.505 --> 07:26.172
No!

07:42.982 --> 07:46.317
I didn't know you were skilled
with broadswords, Prince Zuko.

07:46.402 --> 07:47.694
I'm not.

07:47.903 --> 07:49.404
They're antiques.

07:49.488 --> 07:51.114
Just decorative.

07:51.198 --> 07:54.117
Have you heard of the Blue Spirit,
General Iroh?

07:54.201 --> 07:55.535
Just rumors.

07:55.745 --> 07:57.412
I don't think he is real.

07:57.621 --> 07:59.289
He's real, all right.

07:59.373 --> 08:00.582
He's a criminal

08:00.666 --> 08:02.625
and an enemy of the Fire Nation.

08:02.710 --> 08:06.254
But I have a feeling justice
will catch up with him soon.

08:06.338 --> 08:09.716
General Iroh, the offer
to join my mission still stands...

08:09.925 --> 08:11.342
If you change your mind.

08:16.348 --> 08:18.600
I've waited for this day
my whole life.

08:18.934 --> 08:22.395
I finally get to learn from
a real waterbending master!

08:25.399 --> 08:27.150
Good morning, Master Pakku!

08:27.234 --> 08:28.902
No, please! March right in!

08:28.986 --> 08:31.070
I'm not concentrating or anything.

08:31.363 --> 08:33.531
This is my friend... Katara...

08:33.699 --> 08:34.949
The one I told you about.

08:36.577 --> 08:37.702
I'm sorry.

08:37.787 --> 08:39.871
I think there's been
a misunderstanding.

08:39.955 --> 08:42.165
You didn't tell me
your friend was a girl.

08:42.458 --> 08:44.417
In our tribe, it is forbidden

08:44.502 --> 08:46.961
for women to learn waterbending.

08:55.179 --> 08:57.096
What do you mean, you won't teach me?

08:57.389 --> 08:59.098
I didn't travel
across the entire world

08:59.308 --> 09:00.725
so you could tell me no!

09:01.018 --> 09:02.143
No.

09:02.228 --> 09:04.103
But there must be
other female waterbenders

09:04.188 --> 09:05.230
in your tribe.

09:05.356 --> 09:07.398
Here, the women learn from Yagoda

09:07.483 --> 09:09.359
to use their waterbending to heal.

09:09.568 --> 09:11.319
I'm sure she would be
happy to take you

09:11.403 --> 09:12.737
as her student...

09:12.947 --> 09:14.364
Despite your bad attitude.

09:14.448 --> 09:16.574
I don't want to heal. I want to fight!

09:16.742 --> 09:18.201
I can see that.

09:18.327 --> 09:20.870
But our tribe has customs, rules.

09:20.955 --> 09:22.121
Well, your rules stink!

09:22.206 --> 09:23.373
Yeah!

09:23.457 --> 09:24.624
They're not fair.

09:24.708 --> 09:26.459
If you won't teach Katara, then...

09:26.544 --> 09:27.544
Then what?

09:28.045 --> 09:29.629
Then I won't learn from you!

09:29.713 --> 09:31.881
Well, have fun teaching yourself.

09:31.966 --> 09:33.842
I'm sure you'll do a great job.

09:33.926 --> 09:34.926
Wait!

09:35.010 --> 09:36.886
Aang didn't mean that.

09:37.972 --> 09:39.848
You can't risk your training for me.

09:39.932 --> 09:41.766
You have to learn from Master Pakku,

09:41.976 --> 09:44.143
even if he is a big jerk.

09:47.606 --> 09:49.107
Why don't we get started, then.

09:51.944 --> 09:54.654
Princess Yue, good morning!

09:56.031 --> 09:58.283
Hey, how about that picnic last night?

09:58.367 --> 10:00.910
Boy, your dad sure knows
how to throw a party.

10:00.995 --> 10:02.579
I'm happy you enjoyed yourself.

10:02.913 --> 10:05.039
Well, it wasn't as much fun
after you left.

10:07.543 --> 10:10.378
So, I'm still hoping
we can see more of each other.

10:10.588 --> 10:12.589
Do an activity, you mean?

10:12.673 --> 10:15.341
Yes, at a place...

10:15.426 --> 10:16.801
For some time.

10:16.886 --> 10:18.052
I'd love to.

10:18.137 --> 10:20.096
I'll meet you on that bridge tonight.

10:20.306 --> 10:21.514
Great! I'll see you...

10:21.599 --> 10:23.099
Aagh!

10:23.309 --> 10:25.184
Sorry.

10:26.353 --> 10:28.104
That's ok. It was worth it.

10:29.273 --> 10:31.190
See you tonight.

10:31.483 --> 10:33.151
I'm very impressed.

10:33.485 --> 10:35.820
You all seem highly qualified

10:36.030 --> 10:38.156
for the mission I have in mind.

10:40.367 --> 10:42.243
That's some tasty gold.

10:43.454 --> 10:45.204
What do you need us to do?

10:45.456 --> 10:48.499
I believe you're acquainted
with Prince Zuko.

10:56.592 --> 10:57.967
Um, hi.

10:58.052 --> 10:59.052
Are you Yagoda?

10:59.595 --> 11:01.179
Are you here for the healing lesson?

11:05.851 --> 11:07.101
I guess I am.

11:07.186 --> 11:09.979
Welcome!

11:15.945 --> 11:17.862
You're moving the water around,

11:17.947 --> 11:20.865
but you're not feeling
the push and pull.

11:21.075 --> 11:22.533
I'm trying.

11:25.955 --> 11:27.830
Maybe that move
is too advanced for you.

11:27.915 --> 11:29.874
Why don't you try an easier one?

11:35.631 --> 11:37.465
Thanks for the lesson.

11:37.549 --> 11:39.092
So, who's the lucky boy?

11:40.260 --> 11:41.594
Your betrothal necklace.

11:41.679 --> 11:44.013
You're getting married, right?

11:44.098 --> 11:45.223
No.

11:45.307 --> 11:47.350
I don't think I'm ready for that yet.

11:47.434 --> 11:49.435
My grandmother
gave my mother this necklace,

11:49.520 --> 11:51.396
and my mother passed it down to me.

11:52.648 --> 11:55.525
I recognize this carving!

11:55.609 --> 11:58.111
I don't know
why I didn't realize sooner.

11:58.320 --> 12:00.196
You're the spitting image of Kanna.

12:00.364 --> 12:01.489
Wait!

12:01.573 --> 12:03.533
How do you know my gran-gran's name?

12:03.867 --> 12:06.035
When I was about your age,

12:06.120 --> 12:07.662
I was friends with Kanna.

12:07.871 --> 12:09.580
She was born here...

12:09.665 --> 12:11.124
In the Northern Tribe.

12:11.208 --> 12:12.875
She never told me.

12:12.960 --> 12:15.086
Your grandmother
had an arranged marriage

12:15.170 --> 12:16.671
with a young waterbender.

12:16.880 --> 12:18.923
He carved that necklace for her.

12:19.133 --> 12:22.176
If gran-gran was engaged,
why did she leave?

12:22.261 --> 12:23.761
I don't know.

12:23.887 --> 12:25.805
That's always been a mystery to me.

12:26.015 --> 12:29.225
She left without saying good-bye.

12:29.518 --> 12:31.352
Good luck!

12:33.272 --> 12:36.065
The crew wanted me
to wish you safe travels.

12:36.150 --> 12:38.109
Good riddance to those traitors.

12:38.318 --> 12:40.236
It's a lovely night for a walk.

12:40.320 --> 12:42.113
Why don't you join me?

12:42.197 --> 12:44.073
It would clear your head.

12:46.410 --> 12:48.369
Or just stay in your room

12:48.454 --> 12:50.288
and sit in the dark.

12:50.372 --> 12:52.206
Whatever makes you happy.

13:18.734 --> 13:19.817
Whoa!

13:19.985 --> 13:21.944
Careful with the blasting jelly.

13:24.448 --> 13:25.448
Ooh!

13:26.658 --> 13:27.867
Uncle?

13:28.077 --> 13:29.452
Uncle, is that you?

13:59.608 --> 14:00.608
Aah!

14:12.496 --> 14:13.496
Zuko!

14:22.047 --> 14:23.631
Zuko.

14:34.685 --> 14:36.519
Hi, Princess Yue.

14:36.603 --> 14:38.271
I made you something.

14:38.355 --> 14:39.647
I carved it myself.

14:40.315 --> 14:41.566
It's a bear.

14:41.650 --> 14:44.443
Actually, it's supposed to be a fish.

14:44.528 --> 14:46.362
See, it has a fin.

14:48.490 --> 14:51.367
I'm sorry. I made a mistake.

14:51.577 --> 14:53.494
I shouldn't have
asked you to come here.

15:01.587 --> 15:03.045
How's warrior training going?

15:04.715 --> 15:05.965
That bad?

15:06.175 --> 15:07.967
No, it's Princess Yue.

15:08.051 --> 15:09.218
I don't get it.

15:09.303 --> 15:10.636
One minute,
she wants to go out with me,

15:10.721 --> 15:12.180
and the next,
she's telling me to get lost.

15:13.098 --> 15:15.099
So, how's waterbending training?

15:15.309 --> 15:19.103
Master Poop-head won't teach her
because she's a girl.

15:19.313 --> 15:21.439
Why don't you just teach her, Aang?

15:21.899 --> 15:23.733
Why didn't I think of that?

15:24.151 --> 15:25.443
At night, you can teach me

15:25.527 --> 15:27.653
whatever moves
you learn from Master Pakku.

15:27.738 --> 15:29.405
That way,
you have someone to practice with,

15:29.489 --> 15:31.032
and I get to learn waterbending.

15:31.116 --> 15:32.867
Everyone's happy!

15:32.951 --> 15:34.243
I'm not happy.

15:34.328 --> 15:35.453
But you're never happy.

15:35.537 --> 15:36.787
Come on, Aang.

15:41.919 --> 15:43.211
Master Pakku said this move

15:43.295 --> 15:46.339
is all about sinking and floating.

15:48.383 --> 15:49.383
I got it!

15:51.178 --> 15:52.470
That was amazing!

15:52.679 --> 15:53.804
That wasn't me.

15:56.058 --> 15:58.392
I was just showing Katara a few moves.

15:58.560 --> 16:00.061
You have disrespected me,

16:00.145 --> 16:02.647
my teachings, and my entire culture.

16:02.731 --> 16:03.773
I'm sorry, I...

16:03.857 --> 16:07.568
You are no longer welcome
as my student.

16:14.743 --> 16:16.327
What do you want me to do?

16:16.411 --> 16:18.871
Force Master Pakku to take Aang back

16:18.956 --> 16:19.997
as his student?

16:20.082 --> 16:22.041
Yes. Please.

16:22.125 --> 16:24.919
I suspect he might change his mind

16:25.003 --> 16:28.547
if you swallow your pride
and apologize to him.

16:32.427 --> 16:33.427
Fine.

16:34.179 --> 16:35.930
I'm waiting, little girl.

16:36.848 --> 16:38.015
No!

16:38.100 --> 16:41.560
No way am I apologizing
to a sour old man like you!

16:43.438 --> 16:44.605
Katara...

16:44.690 --> 16:46.983
I'll be outside
if you're man enough to fight me.

16:51.697 --> 16:53.364
I'm sure she didn't mean that.

16:53.448 --> 16:55.032
Yeah, I think she did.

16:57.035 --> 17:00.288
I'm devastated
to hear about Prince Zuko.

17:00.497 --> 17:02.373
Just devastated.

17:03.083 --> 17:05.001
The Fire Lord will not be pleased

17:05.210 --> 17:07.795
when he learns who was responsible.

17:08.005 --> 17:10.589
You know who was behind the attack?

17:11.091 --> 17:13.634
Yes. Pirates.

17:14.261 --> 17:16.637
We had a run-in with them
a while back.

17:16.763 --> 17:18.514
They wanted revenge.

17:20.684 --> 17:23.394
So, have you reconsidered my offer?

17:23.895 --> 17:25.563
Yes, I accept.

17:26.106 --> 17:29.108
It will be an honor
to serve as your general.

17:29.943 --> 17:31.527
To the Fire Nation.

17:31.611 --> 17:32.820
To victory!

17:36.491 --> 17:37.783
Are you crazy, Katara?

17:37.868 --> 17:39.744
You're not gonna win this fight.

17:39.953 --> 17:41.620
I know. I don't care.

17:41.705 --> 17:43.331
You don't have to do this for me.

17:43.415 --> 17:44.874
I can find another teacher.

17:44.958 --> 17:46.709
I'm not doing it for you.

17:46.793 --> 17:49.253
Someone needs to
slap some sense into that guy.

17:50.255 --> 17:52.214
So, you decided to show up?

17:55.886 --> 17:56.886
Aren't you gonna fight?

17:57.220 --> 17:58.637
Go back to the healing huts

17:58.722 --> 18:00.431
with the other women,
where you belong.

18:05.020 --> 18:06.187
Fine.

18:06.271 --> 18:07.813
You want to learn to fight so bad,

18:07.898 --> 18:09.315
study closely.

18:19.785 --> 18:21.285
Don't worry.
I'm not going to hurt you.

18:40.514 --> 18:42.598
You can't knock me down!

18:42.682 --> 18:44.100
Go, Katara!

19:25.600 --> 19:27.476
Well, I'm impressed.

19:27.561 --> 19:29.979
You are an excellent waterbender.

19:30.063 --> 19:32.148
But you still won't teach me,
will you?

19:32.232 --> 19:33.482
No.

19:58.216 --> 19:59.884
This fight is over.

20:00.260 --> 20:02.428
Come back here. I'm not finished yet.

20:02.512 --> 20:04.263
Yes. You are.

20:06.600 --> 20:09.185
This is my necklace.

20:09.352 --> 20:11.979
No, it's not. It's mine. Give it back!

20:12.063 --> 20:14.523
I made this 60 years ago...

20:14.733 --> 20:17.234
For the love of my life...

20:17.444 --> 20:18.569
For Kanna.

20:19.029 --> 20:21.655
My gran-gran
was supposed to marry you?

20:27.537 --> 20:29.788
Our plan is working perfectly.

20:29.998 --> 20:32.249
Zhao doesn't suspect a thing.

20:33.210 --> 20:34.668
You didn't have to do this.

20:34.920 --> 20:38.214
No nephew of mine
is going to stow away on a ship

20:38.298 --> 20:39.548
without some backup.

20:39.758 --> 20:40.883
Thank you, Uncle.

20:42.135 --> 20:43.594
Someone's coming.

20:44.054 --> 20:46.639
Stay hidden
until we get to the North Pole

20:46.723 --> 20:48.974
and the Avatar will be yours.

20:49.059 --> 20:50.476
Good luck.

20:53.355 --> 20:55.397
I carved this necklace
for your grandmother

20:55.482 --> 20:57.399
when we got engaged.

20:57.484 --> 21:01.195
I thought we would have
a long happy life together.

21:01.279 --> 21:02.696
I loved her.

21:02.781 --> 21:04.698
But she didn't love you, did she?

21:04.824 --> 21:06.617
It was an arranged marriage.

21:07.869 --> 21:11.664
Gran-gran wouldn't let your tribe's
stupid customs run her life.

21:11.873 --> 21:13.415
That's why she left.

21:13.625 --> 21:15.543
It must have taken a lot of courage.

21:18.129 --> 21:19.255
Go get her.

21:26.972 --> 21:28.514
What do you want from me?

21:28.848 --> 21:29.890
Nothing.

21:29.975 --> 21:32.893
I just want you to know
I think you're beautiful.

21:32.978 --> 21:35.980
And I never thought a girl like you
would even notice a guy like me.

21:36.064 --> 21:37.565
You don't understand.

21:37.774 --> 21:38.899
No, no.

21:38.984 --> 21:40.401
See, that's the thing.

21:40.485 --> 21:42.111
I think I do understand now.

21:42.320 --> 21:44.697
You're a princess, and I'm...

21:44.781 --> 21:46.282
I'm just a southern peasant.

21:46.491 --> 21:48.033
No, Sokka.

21:48.243 --> 21:49.368
It's ok.

21:49.452 --> 21:50.828
You don't have to say anything.

21:51.580 --> 21:52.705
I'll see you around, ok.

21:56.501 --> 21:59.336
Ok, now I'm really confused!

21:59.546 --> 22:02.214
Happy, but confused.

22:02.299 --> 22:04.758
I do like you... A lot!

22:04.843 --> 22:06.552
But we can't be together.

22:06.636 --> 22:08.721
And not for the reason you think.

22:09.306 --> 22:11.265
It's because...

22:11.349 --> 22:12.975
I'm engaged.

22:14.686 --> 22:16.145
I'm sorry.

22:26.531 --> 22:28.282
Not bad. Not bad.

22:28.366 --> 22:29.450
Ha ha ha ha.

22:29.534 --> 22:31.076
Keep practicing,
and maybe you'll get it

22:31.161 --> 22:32.995
by the time you're my age.

22:35.415 --> 22:36.707
Hey, Katara.

22:36.791 --> 22:38.167
What do you think you're doing?

22:38.752 --> 22:40.419
It's past sunrise.

22:40.503 --> 22:42.046
You're late.

22:42.797 --> 22:44.048
Good to see you here.

22:44.174 --> 22:45.299
You, too.

22:53.642 --> 22:55.559
My fleet is ready.

22:55.810 --> 22:58.604
Set a course
for the Northern Water Tribe.
